==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*6 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Berserkory]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
**10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Capy|Capies]] spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

